# Angular Frontend Task Checklist

## Phase 1: Research & Planning
- [/] Explore backend controllers (gateway, patient-service, auth-service)
- [ ] Identify all REST endpoints (URLs, methods, request/response shapes)
- [ ] Create implementation plan with folder structure

## Phase 2: Project Setup
- [ ] Initialize Angular 17+ project in /frontend
- [ ] Install Angular Material
- [ ] Configure environments (environment.ts / environment.prod.ts)
- [ ] Set up app routing module

## Phase 3: Core Infrastructure
- [ ] Create TypeScript interfaces/models (Patient, Auth, Pagination, ErrorResponse)
- [ ] Create AuthApiService (login)
- [ ] Create PatientApiService (list/get/create/update/delete)
- [ ] Create AuthInterceptor (attach token, handle 401)
- [ ] Create AuthGuard (protect routes)
- [ ] Create ErrorHandlerService / utility

## Phase 4: Pages / Components
- [ ] LoginComponent (/login)
- [ ] PatientListComponent (/patients) - table, search, pagination, loading/error
- [ ] CreatePatientComponent (/patients/new) - reactive form + validation
- [ ] PatientDetailComponent (/patients/:id) - view + edit mode + delete modal

## Phase 5: Shared Components
- [ ] ConfirmDialog component (for delete)
- [ ] Error/notification snackbar integration

## Phase 6: Tests
